: "https://www.v2ex.com/u/shenzhenhk", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_mini.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_normal.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_large.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_xlarge.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_xxlarge.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_xxxlarge.png?m=1773753292", "created": 1691985601, "last_modified": 1773753292, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "lingcong86", "last_touched": 1787489219, "title": "很多过去认为在 apple 上不可能的实现的事现在都实现了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236556", "created": 1787465904, "deleted": 0, "content": "以前大家都认为\r\n\r\n* iOS 绝对不可能开放通话录音，因为这在很多国家是违法的。结果现在可以了。\r\n* carplay 绝对不可能看视频，因为这是危及行车安全的。结果 WWDC26 上也说可以了。\r\n\r\n下一个不可能到可能的功能会是什么？", "content_rendered": "以前大家都认为<br /><br />* iOS 绝对不可能开放通话录音，因为这在很多国家是违法的。结果现在可以了。<br />* carplay 绝对不可能看视频，因为这是危及行车安全的。结果 WWDC26 上也说可以了。<br /><br />下一个不可能到可能的功能会是什么？", "last_modified": 1787465904, "replies": 30, "id": 1236556}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/2d6c/c4b2/507_large.png?m=1768280131", "name": "cv", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/2d6c/c4b2/507_normal.png?m=1768280131", "title": "求职", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/cv", "topics": 9121, "footer": "", "header": "欢迎在这里发布自己的求职简历。", "title_alternative": "CV", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/2d6c/c4b2/507_mini.png?m=1768280131", "stars": 1796, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 507, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 675325, "username": "SocratesQ", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/SocratesQ", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3de2468370a1db61d3e282f79a75a282?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3de2468370a1db61d3e282f79a75a282?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3de2468370a1db61d3e282f79a75a282?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1707448533, "last_modified": 1782269042, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "catazshadow", "last_touched": 1787500406, "title": "[招人]杭州，产品研发，后端开发 3 年以上经验来看", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236533", "created": 1787457579, "deleted": 0, "content": "你好，根据本岗位的实际需要，需要求职者具备以下必要条件，为了节省双方时间，请仔细核对后决定是否进行下一步沟通：\r\n1.计科、软工、网工、大数据、人工智能、信管等计算机相关专业毕业；\r\n2.具有从毕业后 3 年以上（含 3 年）的工作经验；\r\n3.熟练掌握 Python 或 golang 开发语言，并能够进行 AI 应用的开发，仅能 vibe coding 进行工作的此项不合格；\r\n4.具备真实的 AI 商业项目落地经验。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n以上条件都满足，请选择一个参与的项目进行简短介绍。", "content_rendered": "你好，根据本岗位的实际需要，需要求职者具备以下必要条件，为了节省双方时间，请仔细核对后决定是否进行下一步沟通：<br />1.计科、软工、网工、大数据、人工智能、信管等计算机相关专业毕业；<br />2.具有从毕业后 3 年以上（含 3 年）的工作经验；<br />3.熟练掌握 Python 或 golang 开发语言，并能够进行 AI 应用的开发，仅能 vibe coding 进行工作的此项不合格；<br />4.具备真实的 AI 商业项目落地经验。<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />以上条件都满足，请选择一个参与的项目进行简短介绍。", "last_modified": 1787457579, "replies": 29, "id": 1236533}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 4557, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3305, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 56707, "username": "nanoxx", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/nanoxx", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ad8db7633e0e1c1c975545a18c95ec53?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ad8db7633e0e1c1c975545a18c95ec53?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ad8db7633e0e1c1c975545a18c95ec53?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1393233355, "last_modified": 1674095343, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "antidoom", "last_touched": 1787506308, "title": "Codex 又要重置了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236559", "created": 1787466750, "deleted": 0, "content": "Tibo • @thsottiaux•19 分钟\n\nUpdate on rate limits in Codex.\n\nWe&#39;ve found (a) some inefficiencies when using images in long sessions with multiple compactions (b) high p95+ usage for Computer History (c) a feature that was meant to generate conversation titles that was draining a bit more usage than intended. And we have a tiger team combing through everything and shipping fixes tomorrow. We also found a novel approach to drive efficiency up significantly that is completely unrelated and we will be working on next week.\n\n__As part of some of the fixes tomorrow, we will also do a full reset of the usage for all paid subscriptions.__\n\nSee you then.", "content_rendered": "<p>Tibo • @<a href=\"/member/thsottiaux\">thsottiaux</a>•19 分钟</p>\n<p>Update on rate limits in Codex.</p>\n<p>We've found (a) some inefficiencies when using images in long sessions with multiple compactions (b) high p95+ usage for Computer History (c) a feature that was meant to generate conversation titles that was draining a bit more usage than intended. And we have a tiger team combing through everything and shipping fixes tomorrow. We also found a novel approach to drive efficiency up significantly that is completely unrelated and we will be working on next week.</p>\n<p><strong>As part of some of the fixes tomorrow, we will also do a full reset of the usage for all paid subscriptions.</strong></p>\n<p>See you then.</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787466750, "replies": 29, "id": 1236559}]